    "id": "LinearAlgebra.prop.independentIffUniqueRepresentation",
    "package": "LinearAlgebra",
    "kind": "property",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "zh-CN",
      "values": {
        "zh-CN": "表示唯一性判据",
        "en": "Uniqueness of Representation"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "thm-hyp(list-partial(\n  LA.VectorSpace(V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace, $\\mathbb{K}$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace),\n  Type.annotation(@n@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, Nat),\n  Type.annotation(@$\\alpha$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, Type.to(LA.Fin(n@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily), V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace))\n), Logic.iff(LA.LinearlyIndependent($\\alpha$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace), LA.UniqueRepresentation($\\alpha$@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.finiteFamily, V@LinearAlgebra.ctxt.vectorSpace)))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "zh-CN",
        "values": {
          "zh-CN": "$\\alpha$ 线性无关当且仅当每个可由 $\\alpha$ 表示的向量具有唯一系数族。",
          "en": "$\\alpha$ is independent iff every represented vector has a unique coefficient family."
        }
      }
    },
